# A Map literal inside an interpolation may hold a String key that is itself
# a closing brace. Subtle because that brace sits inside a quoted String and
# must not end the interpolation.
#= {result: 'got 1 and 2', inputs: {m: {['}']: 2}}}
def {m} = import('inputs')
$'got ${ {['}']: 1}['}'] } and ${m['}']}'
